{"uid":"58e2fa44c10dd7c9","name":"[BUG-TXN-001] TC-TXN-001 — Transaction list: negative page (-1) must return 400","fullName":"backend-deep-regression-api.spec.ts:1093:7","historyId":"d50f58921e89f8e9164cb5c9699901e0:0a57f3b857957165fe2b6d3d8c1216fb","time":{"start":1788974861230,"stop":1788974862540,"duration":1310},"description":"**[BUG-TXN-001]**\n\nPassing `page=-1` to the transaction list endpoint should return 400 Bad Request. A negative page index is not meaningful and indicates a client error.\n\n**Expected:** HTTP 400 with `\"message\":\"page must be >= 0\"`\n\n**Impact:** If the server treats page=-1 as page=0 (common ORM behaviour), results are silently incorrect with no indication to the client. If it errors at the DB layer, it produces a confusing 500.","descriptionHtml":"<p><strong>[BUG-TXN-001]</strong></p>\n<p>Passing <code>page=-1</code> to the transaction list endpoint should return 400 Bad Request. A negative page index is not meaningful and indicates a client error.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected:</strong> HTTP 400 with <code>&quot;message&quot;:&quot;page must be &gt;= 0&quot;</code></p>\n<p><strong>Impact:</strong> If the server treats page=-1 as page=0 (common ORM behaviour), results are silently incorrect with no indication to the client. If it errors at the DB layer, it produces a confusing 500.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"testStage":{"description":"**[BUG-TXN-001]**\n\nPassing `page=-1` to the transaction list endpoint should return 400 Bad Request. A negative page index is not meaningful and indicates a client error.\n\n**Expected:** HTTP 400 with `\"message\":\"page must be >= 0\"`\n\n**Impact:** If the server treats page=-1 as page=0 (common ORM behaviour), results are silently incorrect with no indication to the client. If it errors at the DB layer, it produces a confusing 500.","status":"passed","steps":[{"name":"B